(h) each Daily Compounded CORRA Loan shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof from the applicable borrowing date at a rate per annum equal to the Daily Compounded CORRA plus the Applicable Margin;

(i) each Euro Swing Line Loan shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof from the applicable borrowing date at a rate per annum equal to the Money Market Rate plus the Applicable Margin;
(j) each Substitute Rate Loan shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof from the applicable borrowing date at a rate per annum equal to the Substitute Rate;
(k) each Supplemental Committed Loan shall bear interest as set forth in the applicable Supplemental Addendum; and
(l) each Bid Loan shall bear interest on the outstanding principal amount thereof for the Interest Period therefor at a rate per annum equal to the Eurocurrency Rate for such Interest Period plus (or minus) the Eurocurrency Bid Margin, Term SOFR Bid Margin or at the Absolute Rate for such Interest Period, as the case may be.

